title: "pastatemp: Paired Air and Stream Temperature Analysis (PASTA) at the annual and diel scales"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hare
    given-names: Danielle
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
    # affiliation: ""
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Haredkb/PASTA_diel"
keywords:
  - stream temperature
  - air temperature
  - groundwater
  - thermal sensitivity
  - PASTA
abstract: >-
  Python package and Streamlit app for paired air and stream temperature
  analysis (PASTA). Reads logger files, sorts air and stream loggers, pairs
  them by name (data as a last resort), and fits annual and diel sinusoids to
  report amplitude ratio, phase lag, mean ratio and thermal sensitivity.
  A Python port of the PASTA and Diel PASTA R code.
